            <ArticleTitle>Managing the Complex Patient with Degenerative Cervical Myelopathy: How to Handle the Aging Spine, the Obese Patient, and Individuals with Medical Comorbidities.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>177-184</MedlinePgn>
